          "value": "Find the coordinates of the vector $x$ relative to the basis $B={{b}_{1},{b}_{2},{b}_{3}},$ where\n\n$$\n{b}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]$ then what is the value of ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$",
